# Task 7B raw rendered pixel arrays (regeneratable from protocol.json +
# fast_render.py) and its live stdout log: excluded for the same reason
# *.npz caches already are project-wide -- reproducible intermediate
# data, not a required git artifact, and at this task's N=1024/1463-scene
# scale (~1.6GB projected) committing it while Stage 1 is still actively
# rendering would mean repeated multi-hundred-MB diffs. The actual
# required artifacts (protocol.json/md, split_manifest.json,
# stage1_data_manifest.json, learning curve/selection/sealed-test/
# structure-test JSON results) are plain JSON and are committed normally.
experiments/task7b_latent_transformation_discovery/rendered/
experiments/task7b_latent_transformation_discovery/*.log
